  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/AD4/29b96dd> ;
  triage:notes "Per-branch closure required: each affected sprint's own branch must be fixed (one-line frontmatter edit per branch). Standing practice recommendation: arch-ctm should set `status: complete` once sprint's own validation passes, preventing this recurring on AD.6-AD.11." .

